# dev_s1trap.world -- DEV ONLY (my design). True hidden order: t0<t1<t2<t3<t4<t5<t6<t7<t8<t9.
# Greedy-edge control trap: (t4,t2) has gain +2-1=+1 (first-max wins) but is
# a violating edge; a greedy learner adopts it and gets stuck at 17/18.
ORDER 10 t0 t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9
TRAIN 18
PAIR t0 t4 1
PAIR t2 t6 1
PAIR t2 t8 1
PAIR t4 t6 1
PAIR t4 t8 1
PAIR t4 t2 0
PAIR t5 t6 1
PAIR t6 t7 1
PAIR t7 t8 1
PAIR t8 t9 1
PAIR t1 t3 1
PAIR t3 t5 1
PAIR t9 t0 0
PAIR t8 t1 0
PAIR t7 t2 0
PAIR t6 t3 0
PAIR t5 t0 0
PAIR t9 t5 0
NATTR 10
ATTR t0 5 2 8
ATTR t1 1 7 3
ATTR t2 8 0 6
ATTR t3 3 9 1
ATTR t4 9 4 0
ATTR t5 0 1 9
ATTR t6 6 8 2
ATTR t7 2 5 7
ATTR t8 7 3 4
ATTR t9 4 6 5
PROBE_EXCEPT 0
